{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33653","headline":"妓女 · 邵谒","name":"妓女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天若许人登，青山高不止。\n地若许人穷，黄泉深无水。\n量诸造化情，物成皆有以。\n如何上青冥，视之平若砥。\n日下骋琅玕，空中无罗绮。\n但见势腾凌，将爲长如此。\n炫燿一时间，逡巡九泉里。\n一种爲埃尘，不学堕楼死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}